# Out of git because the token this repository is pushed with has no "workflow"
# scope, so GitHub refuses any push that touches .github/workflows outright.
# No workflow is committed and no CI runs on this repository; there is no
# with-ci-workflow branch to restore one from, whatever an earlier version of
# this comment said. To add CI, drop this entry and push the file with a token
# that has the scope, or create it in GitHub under Actions -> New workflow,
# which needs no token at all.
.github/workflows/
